r why my partner and I were going into the Earth Computer... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"But I can assure you, we weren't going to do anything bad!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"SuperShorty","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"BOSS-9","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Architect","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Good or bad, it doesn't matter. Every terrible villain who wanted to rule the world would make big fancy speeches before committing crimes that were far more disgusting than mass murder. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"But what I meant was...what do you plan to do now? Join me? Or are you going to find a place to hide?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"SuperShorty","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"BOSS-9","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Super-Shorty","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I've been in a state of confusion ever since I woke up... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"But I need to find a way to recover my memory, figure out who I am, as well as what S.F. has to do with me... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Therefore...we have the same objectives for the time being, at least. Dana...how about you?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"SuperShorty","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"Dana","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Dana","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I want to turn around and go home, because there are large mechs outside waiting to kill me. Or I can beat the crap out of them one by one and fall asleep to a lullaby of gunfire from outside the window."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"SuperShorty","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"Dana","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Dana","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"But right now, you're busy wrecking an evil conspiracy, and the tw